ECOSYSTEM CARVE-OUT

The following are explicitly NOT considered derivative works of LoonBox and
may be distributed under any license their authors choose:

  1. Feathers (themes) — files distributed as .loonfeather packages or
     placed in the ~/.loonbox/feathers/ directory, which customize the
     visual appearance of LoonBox through the documented feather manifest
     format.

  2. Extensions (plugins) — files distributed as .loonext packages or
     placed in the ~/.loonbox/extensions/ directory, which extend LoonBox
     functionality through the documented Lua extension API.

This carve-out applies only to feathers and extensions that interact with
LoonBox solely through the documented public APIs (feather manifest format
and Lua extension API). Code that links against, embeds, or modifies
LoonBox internals remains subject to the AGPL-3.0.

